Package: mycomapatlas
Type: Package
Title: MycoMap Atlas: Distribution Models from DNA-Validated Records
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("MycoMap", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "steve@biodiverselabs.io")
Description: Fits and publishes species distribution models for fungi from
    DNA-validated MycoMap records. Reads mycomap.org through its read-only SQL
    route, fits Maxent (maxnet) and boosted-tree models against a target-group
    background drawn from the same validated universe, evaluates them with
    spatially blocked folds, and publishes versioned map and metric releases
    that mycomap.org and MycoMap Vision read over HTTP.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
